      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairview%2C_California",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Since 1903, Lone Tree Cemetery has held an annual Memorial Day ceremony, one of the oldest continuous observances in southern Alameda County.",
